valid boundary_ref. Closing an interaction group does not establish real task completion. The whole proposal must preserve attribution, hypothetical worlds and uncertainty. Return unknown or contradicts if its organizing proposition or transition is unsupported, even when every source is authentic. Do not repair the proposition or replace unknown with supports.
